{"title":"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A math club had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> members in its first year. In the second year, the membership increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />. How many members were there in the second year?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/c/45c9b3475aad0fe1894ca3c6b3487e46941aabab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 54 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 48 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 36 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 42 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the membership increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e741e1b87acae6e81015a728b046ebce4d21e3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\% \\times 24 = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 24 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"196\" height=\"38\" /> new members. Thus, in the second year of the math club, there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e2bc4478742a64d4ea06db6689be86f8a5c1484.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24 + 12 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"149\" height=\"30\" /> members.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat\">2026 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b>